# A local development tab, kept out of the default take (it would pass 40 seconds;
# the sample app's row shows its host and port in every frame anyway). A click on the
# sample app served from localhost:5173; on screen its row wears the dashed yellow
# outline, with the host and port under its title. It needs Work on screen, so it goes
# right after colour: --scenes hero,colour,local,bar,spaces,split,dark,rail,end.
# The sample app's row at y = 493.
shot @MARKS@/local.png
glide 150 493 0.4
wait 0.2
click 150 493
wait 1.7
